along by Sufi Muslims on the Hajj or pilgrimage. And here we also know it caused a sensation

177
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:56,160
because we also see an explosion in writing, with a poem found in Mecca dating back to the 15th

178
00:17:56,160 --> 00:18:02,800
century saying, and I quote, “Coffee is our gold. Wherever it is served, one enjoys the society of

179
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:08,400
the noblest and most generous men.” End quote. It was also in Mecca where coffee would

180
